# At the beginning of Bot1's first main phase on turn 3, Thousand Moons Smithy's trigger asks whether to tap five untapped
# artifacts and/or creatures. Six are there (the Smithy, its Gnome Soldier and four Ornithoppers); Bot1 accepts and chooses
# five, the Smithy itself among them (an effect's tap, not a {T} cost, CR 701.26a), leaving the fourth Ornithopter untapped.
# The Smithy transforms (CR 701.27a) into Barracks of the Thousand, a legendary artifact land that stays the same tapped
# permanent (CR 712.18), so it adds no mana this turn: its {T} ability is not offered. The Gnome Soldier counts the
# Barracks, still an artifact, and the four Ornithopters: 6/6.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Thousand Moons Smithy
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

